  first | exact @GlobalTheory.OTY.TwEst.quot_holo_measurable | exact GlobalTheory.OTY.TwEst.quot_holo_measurable | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.OTY.TwEst.quot_holo_measurable <;> assumption)
